done	<str>I returned to Steve and he introduced me to Old Grog, a privateer hunting Will and Anne. Old Grog agreed to let me join him, but told me I'd need to get more experience out at sea first. Steve assured me that he'd keep me informed of any updates from Old Grog and encouraged me to head back out on my new Raft to begin working on my sailing skills.</str>
